        "created_at": "2014-04-23T23:23:43.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>You really aren't going to beat $4 a mini, and the KS is cheaper than that.</p><p>If you aren't painting them yourself it's the best option.</p><p>Even then if you don't have a good amount of paints it will be tough to match the coloring schemes, and it generally takes a while to get good at the process.</p><p>It also takes a long time to do a good job.</p>",
